# ShadowAi

Local AI inference Android application with multi-provider support.

## Setup

### Prerequisites
- Android Studio Hedgehog or newer
- JDK 17
- Android SDK 36

### Pre-commit Hooks

This project uses pre-commit hooks for code quality:

```bash
# Install pre-commit (if not already installed)
pip install pre-commit

# Install hooks in the repository
pre-commit install

# Run manually on all files
pre-commit run --all-files
```

Hooks include:
- ktlint (Kotlin code formatting)
- EOF fixer
- Trailing whitespace removal

### Building

```bash
./gradlew :app:assembleDebug
```

### Project Structure

- `app/` - Main Android application
- `backend/` - Ktor server for image generation APIs
- `core-contracts/` - Shared interfaces and data classes
- `provider-adapters/` - AI provider implementations (OpenAI, Anthropic, local)
- `artifact-system/` - Media/file handling
- `ui-params/`, `ui-composition/` - UI components and design system
- `diagnostics/` - Debug and logging tools
- `hot-swapping/` - Dynamic model/provider switching
- `pipeline-planner/` - Request routing and orchestration
- `model-catalog/` - Model definitions and metadata
- `ui-validator/` - Custom lint rules

## CI/CD

GitHub Actions workflow included for:
- Build verification
- ktlint checks
- Android lint
- Unit tests
- OWASP dependency vulnerability scan

